---
title: Spanish Rice
author: Aunt Vera McFall
category: Casseroles
cook time: 1 hour
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@rice{1%cup}
@salt{1%dash}
@raw hamburger{1%lb}
@onion (cut up)
@celery
@green pepper
@tomato juice{1%small can}
@butter{few pieces}
@paprika
@sugar{2%tsp}
@ketchup{1%dash or two}

Cook 1 c rice with a dash of salt. Add raw hamburger, some cut up onion, celery and green pepper. Add small can of tomato juice, a few pieces of butter, some paprika, 2 tsp of sugar and a dash or two of ketchup. Bake at 350 degrees for about 1 hour.
